# acidrain - phrygian 303 line, filter wide open
bpm 134
swing 20
humanize kick 4
humanize hat 4
humanize oh 4
humanize clap 4
humanize snare 4
humanize perc 4
humanize bass 4
humanize stab 4
kick x...x...x...x...
hat x..x..x.x..x..x.
clap ....x.......x...
